{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"no\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Our analysis revealed that the decreases in the PMC alpha power (β = 0.154, p = 0.035) (Fig. 4A) and increases in PMC-STN alpha coherence (β = 0.205, p = 0.006) (Fig. 4B) during the TurnPre phase, but not the TurnStart phase, significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\",\n    \"The fixed effects were defined as the normalized electrophysiological changes, calculated by:\",\n    \"Percentage Change (%) = (Value_Walk - Value_TurnPre or TurnStart) / Value_Walk × 100\",\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Our analysis revealed that the decreases in the PMC alpha power (β = 0.154, p = 0.035) (Fig. 4A) and increases in PMC-STN alpha coherence (β = 0.205, p = 0.006) (Fig. 4B) during the TurnPre phase, but not the TurnStart phase, significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\",\n    \"The fixed effects were defined as the normalized electrophysiological changes, calculated by:\",\n    \"Percentage Change (%) = (Value_Walk - Value_TurnPre or TurnStart) / Value_Walk × 100\",\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的方向不一致判断没有充分依据。正文Results段确实只说PMC-STN alpha coherence的增加能够预测freezing duration，没有明确使用longer或shorter描述关联方向；图注则明确说明增加coherence预测较短的冻结事件。但关键在于Methods给出的回归变量定义为(Walk-TurnPre)/Walk×100，而该变量的回归系数为正值β=0.205。也就是说，TurnPre coherence相对于Walk增加时，回归变量反而减小；在正回归系数下，这对应较短而不是较长的冻结持续时间。因此，回归系数、变量定义与图注的方向实际上相互一致。正文没有明确用文字交代关联方向，不等于正文报告了与图注相反的方向。指控者关于正文没有明确说增加coherence预测更长冻结、报告将表述不充分误判为方向矛盾的描述有全文依据。需要补充的限定是：虽然Results正文没有直接写出shorter，但结合Methods中的变量定义和正回归系数，全文实际上可以推导出与图注一致的方向。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b80f7b05-c3d7-4be4-86ec-dc107ac74c71", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T204331914972Z", "elapsed_seconds": 154.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T20:46:06.586049+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5c1f29015bae1bffe9e7231b367a4730d526e47c13bc268fbd094baa18848d86", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T204331914972Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3b6a3bbab5bb742ca1c389b9e002d7c8c5964a73f9da9011e2f02224c70f405e"}}}
